(text "C602 is the flying capacitor: FLY to SW, never GND.\nQ601 source -> RESE -> R602; keep switch loops short.\nPanel generates HV. No external HV supply injection." (at 21.59 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b136a84a-d3fc-5934-a495-b415691e4d23"))
(text "CS defaults HIGH; CLK/MOSI/DC/RESET LOW. EPD rail supplies U601." (at 21.59 260.35 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8690f872-0119-591d-8703-e9bfc1e14c88"))
(text "OFF / unplugged: BUSY LOW is invalid, not ready.\nFinish refresh, sleep panel, hold safe pins before OFF." (at 270.51 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "636b8eed-bae5-5a70-9c37-d89c7c0f2c65"))
(text "FPC uses retained passive extension. BS1=0, write-only SPI. VDD_INT has its own capacitor; it is not the 3.3V rail." (at 15.24 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "52c634e1-a64c-5def-bf75-d7856325a4f9"))
